Yes the Tourist is a "physical class", but not in that way.  They're
lovers not fighters.  And also can find their way to at least one
altar.

Rogues almost match racial Rangers at ranged combat and have several
advantages in hand to hand.  They start with a sack rather than a
cloak, but a decent (if not great) cloak is easy to find.

Healers make great pet people, even if they can't summon them out of
thin air that well.

